<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29519" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mōmentārĭus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>brief, of brief duration, momentary; quick</i> (postclass.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">maritus,</span>”
				i. e. <i>who stays but a short time</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 5, p. 164, 21</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vita,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 2</span></i>
			, p. 127, 24: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cura,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Dig.
					34, 1, 8</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>instantaneous</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">venenum,</span>”
				<i>that operates quickly</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 10, p. 281, 7</span></i>
			.</div>
